@ifnottex
@node Top
@top PPS Mode

PPS Mode is a spreadsheet browser and editor for GNU Emacs.  It reads and
writes the Pinnacle Point Spreadsheet (@file{.pps}) format and presents the
workbook as a compact keyboard driven grid.

This manual describes PPS Mode version 0.0.1.
@end ifnottex

